{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0274_1000_p", "source_sha256": "1811c87982912c864ed87ab16f37e4806f6a2add0120141edef36ce9a285fee9", "ja": "（ここはニューヨーク……今日は歩のPV撮影だ！\n少し時間が空いたので、散歩に出た）", "zh": "（这里是纽约……今天要拍摄步的PV！正好有点空闲时间，就出来散散步。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0274_1001_034ayu", "source_sha256": "4437a0eabbc522c9a3d291e37e961c7564b31b07a8d572813b520c32dba5522b", "ja": "すーっ……はーっ……ん～っ！\nこれだよこれ、アメリカの空気！　やっぱいいな～♪", "zh": "吸——呼——嗯～！\n就是这个，这就是美国的空气！果然很棒啊～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0274_1002_p", "source_sha256": "055b8cc7388f993201e77592a792748a8ad6859a9d723c5cf9eeaa390080c160", "ja": "歩、テンション上がってるな。\nやっぱりニューヨークだからか？", "zh": "步，你情绪很高涨啊。\n果然是因为这里是纽约吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0274_1003_034ayu", "source_sha256": "3a1a8263eda76dd1c668913b5d478689241e91bab5654927bfabbbfcfe6c4d54", "ja": "もちろん！　アメリカは、アタシの心の故郷だからね。\nそういう意味でも、最高のPVにしたいし……。", "zh": "当然啦！毕竟美国可是我心灵的故乡啊。\n从这个角度来说，我也想拍出最棒的MV……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0274_1004_034ayu", "source_sha256": "3aed064973d490feae2d966d675f5b8356ab078554acce8930c0b3fb14f3954d", "ja": "それに、この歌はちょっと特別っていうか……\nなんか昔を思い出すんだよね。", "zh": "而且，这首歌该怎么说呢，有点特别……\n总觉得会让人想起以前的事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0274_1005_p", "source_sha256": "3cc82109a38a5dbcdc04c54b4f9d1be16b197e249f782038af8f1b20b3075765", "ja": "ダンス留学していた頃の事か？", "zh": "是说你去国外学习舞蹈那段时间吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0274_1006_034ayu", "source_sha256": "c8463c55897d60e7b29a2bd1485bda19d033a11d7d478f3bb159cff0b496fee5", "ja": "そう！　といっても、カッコ悪い話なんだけど……。", "zh": "没错！不过说起来，这可是件挺丢脸的事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0274_1007_034ayu", "source_sha256": "9ebfad1409eae6692f75c2edb0385999276c2234f5d4930b9b5e9bf612b77ca1", "ja": "ブレイクダンスに、すっごく\n難易度の高い技があるんだけどさ。", "zh": "霹雳舞里有个难度特别高的动作。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0274_1008_034ayu", "source_sha256": "a806cea4d4a9a8fe7c9ca27592a3a027e476ffe717c4f53fcc442df2233378c9", "ja": "そのころのアタシは、それがどうしてもできなくって\n……悔しくて、よくひとりで泣いてたなーって。", "zh": "那时候的我怎么都做不到那个动作……不甘心，经常一个人偷偷哭呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0274_1009_034ayu", "source_sha256": "8a16823ee1751775c88de4999dcd138e6b96d6a94dd51e45e97de392f429baf5", "ja": "あ、あははっ。暗いよね、アタシ！", "zh": "啊、啊哈哈。感觉自己好阴沉啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0274_1010_p", "source_sha256": "f29ac43bd51eb9baa9a36f8f6c144f77f1d36542edff859cb932c6f1297cf1e1", "ja": "そんな事ないよ、歩。\nそれに落ち込んでいたら、誰だってそうなる。", "zh": "没那回事，步。\n而且，换作任何人在消沉的时候都会这样的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0274_1011_034ayu", "source_sha256": "9c5b69473cea5e0d2dc7e06998448e9474a1afce97d962a9c07cedca35a48b52", "ja": "うん……ありがと、{$P$}……。", "zh": "嗯……谢谢你，{$P$}……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0274_1012_034ayu", "source_sha256": "c207b6d54b032ca88f2818429a5134d10d301d1ec59f7092437f0228eaf4c976", "ja": "で、その時、ふと目に入ったんだよね。\n部屋に飾ってた、思い出の靴がさ……。", "zh": "然后，那时候无意间看到了。\n摆在房间里的那双回忆之鞋……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0274_1013_p", "source_sha256": "35304e9e459c0b64e3d91a6bbeef53ba6670d2caa2b813b56260248114be2d36", "ja": "靴？　……前にJelly PoP Beansの\n配信で話してたやつか。", "zh": "鞋？……是之前在Jelly PoP Beans的直播里说过的那个吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0274_1014_034ayu", "source_sha256": "6739a61f4dc451b38a05238a3e230d064421ba6b54ea3b72247c23a794f5f83a", "ja": "イエス！　その靴を見てたら、\nすっごく大事なことを思い出したんだ。", "zh": "没错！看到那双鞋，我就想起了一件特别重要的事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0274_1015_034ayu", "source_sha256": "e8b4238ad57fc3c5ddc8ed3b4763a63e690434243950c7815f8ee22f1b526564", "ja": "この靴を履いてた小学生のころも、\nできないことばっかだったなって。", "zh": "我上小学穿这双鞋的时候，也总觉得有好多做不到的事啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0274_1016_034ayu", "source_sha256": "bdc2c912d821e54a5cd48303a77eba83146804cbb5f7af7f9521fb99271980f5", "ja": "だったら絶対、できるようになってやる！って。\n……で、今のアタシがいるってワケ♪", "zh": "既然这样，那我就一定要做到！……所以，才有了现在的我♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0274_1017_p", "source_sha256": "d10c98a27e59cf25c10bf5eef775493fe991dd0a95f7d6d1817b23450e1c87ce", "ja": "そうか。……頑張ったんだな、歩。", "zh": "这样啊。……你努力过了啊，步。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0274_1018_034ayu", "source_sha256": "c14d9d8501753f7831b5fe3e1e1a17d0a890e15d9b2725a5edad2a0d62856bc6", "ja": "へへ……だから今日も、楽しむって決めたんだ。\n失敗しても気にせず、アタシらしく踊ろうって！", "zh": "嘿嘿……所以我决定，今天也要尽情享受。\n就算失败了也不在意，要跳出属于自己的风格！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0274_1019_034ayu", "source_sha256": "3c9a540a8c2e5f571c34b598911e7388bc3e344218af9bb650f1e69da8cadca7", "ja": "{$P$}、見ててよ。\n今日はアタシらしく、最高に輝いてみせるから♪", "zh": "{$P$}，看好了。\n今天我会以自己的方式，绽放出最耀眼的光芒给你看♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0274_1020_p", "source_sha256": "5eea743122580255282fb8fbd2917ff3bba166c6d2439c5ded9e5b2002fec860", "ja": "（その後の撮影でも、歩はのびのびとしていた。\nこのPVはきっと、素晴らしいものに仕上がるだろう）", "zh": "（在那之后的拍摄中，步依然十分自在。这支PV一定会制作得非常棒。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
